{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras/f434669d9714bcf3a4a1cc4a600ad4fc.avif?t=1760690961\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras_big/f434669d9714bcf3a4a1cc4a600ad4fc.avif?t=1760690961 width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><strong>Forge your legend in Sands of Avalon \u2014 where gods, myths, and warriors collide.</strong> <br>Step into a living, breathing fantasy world inspired by ancient civilizations and medieval lore. Players can choose their path as mighty warriors, cunning rangers, or powerful mages, belonging to unique races such as Romans, Egyptians, or Valeborn knights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice matters \u2014 from your allegiance to a god who blesses you with power (and curses you with consequences), to your progression through a deep passive skill tree with hundreds of nodes and keystones. Build unique characters, explore dangerous dungeons, battle rival guilds and factions, and carve your place in Avalon\u2019s history.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Character Progression</strong> \u2013 Create unique builds through a massive passive skill tree with notables and keystones.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras/adc2c6668da4d4402ba087e09994df06.avif?t=1760690961\" width=1560 height=698 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Core Classes, Three Races</strong> \u2013 Choose between Warriors, Mages, and Rangers across Roman, Egyptian, and Valeborn lineages.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras/e9a300b201466132ae4aaf73d8c1ea1b.avif?t=1760690961\" width=1300 height=1920 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras/cd876803a73521b32ed2fe4295bfcd95.avif?t=1760690961\" width=1300 height=1920 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras/7bb35811fe47f9164d89024b5773650a.avif?t=1760690961\" width=1300 height=1920 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>God Allegiance System</strong> \u2013 Align with ancient gods like Anubis or Ra for powerful blessings and dangerous curses.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras/deae0652b517f0594f27929608c47f44.avif?t=1760690961\" width=1300 height=1920 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras/f8c6f4c5fb65e903b34333e37a5c7b9d.avif?t=1760690961\" width=1300 height=1920 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Adventure</strong> \u2013 Traverse diverse biomes, hub zones, and instanced dungeons filled with secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras/2ffeb47946972b8d0f1cbf6a02247bb6.avif?t=1760690961\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Economy</strong> \u2013 Gather resources, craft gear, and trade through a dynamic in-game marketplace with real economic depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvE &amp; PvP Combat</strong> \u2013 Challenge fearsome monsters, conquer dungeons, and engage in clan-based PvP battles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras/ea1ff906356a7e90fbc83033e2fac321.avif?t=1760690961\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living World</strong> \u2013 Seasonal updates bring new content, gods, and abilities to keep the adventure alive.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052670?t=1760690961","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/254b4c42d43d5b8ffddc7582f5baa5e617c1cc74/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760690961","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/7a88c7a668a445281159c07a366063d64508bf1f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760690961","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/7a88c7a668a445281159c07a366063d64508bf1f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760690961","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras/f434669d9714bcf3a4a1cc4a600ad4fc.avif?t=1760690961\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052670/extras_big/f4346